### Qatar SME ERP — end-to-end payroll demo
### Run top to bottom (VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio or Rider). Requires the API on http://localhost:5080.

@api = http://localhost:5080
@company = demo-trading

### 1. Provision a company (platform admin)
POST {{api}}/api/platform/tenants
X-Platform-Key: dev-platform-key
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "code": "{{company}}",
  "nameEn": "Demo Trading WLL",
  "nameAr": "شركة العرض للتجارة ذ.م.م",
  "crNo": "123456",
  "establishmentId": "1234567",
  "adminEmail": "owner@demo.qa",
  "adminPassword": "Demo-Password-2026",
  "adminNameEn": "Demo Owner",
  "adminNameAr": "مالك الشركة",
  "preferredLanguage": "ar"
}

### 2. Log in
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantCode": "{{company}}", "email": "owner@demo.qa", "password": "Demo-Password-2026" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. WPS settings (employer establishment ID and the paying bank account)
# Read current settings first, then PUT them back with these fields filled in.
GET {{api}}/api/hr/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{api}}/api/hr/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employerEid": "1234567", "payerEid": "1234567", "payerQid": null,
  "payerBankShortName": "QNBA", "payerIban": "QA54QNBA000000000000693123456", "sifFormatVersion": "1",
  "gratuityDaysPerYear": 21, "gratuityDivisor": 30, "gratuityMinServiceMonths": 12,
  "dailyRateDivisor": 30, "hoursPerDay": 8,
  "overtimeNormalRate": 1.25, "overtimeNightRate": 1.5, "overtimeRestDayRate": 1.5, "overtimeHolidayRate": 1.5,
  "deductionCapPercent": 50, "minimumBasicWage": 1000, "minimumHousingAllowance": 500, "minimumFoodAllowance": 300,
  "wpsDepositDays": 7
}

### 4. Hire an employee
# @name hire
POST {{api}}/api/hr/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "empNo": "E001", "nameEn": "Ramesh Kumar", "nameAr": "راميش كومار", "nationality": "IN", "gender": "Male",
  "joiningDate": "2024-03-01", "qid": "28435612345", "jobTitleEn": "Storekeeper",
  "iban": "QA54QNBA000000000000693123456"
}

###
@employeeId = {{hire.response.body.id}}

### 5. Employment contract (minimum wage and allowance rules are enforced)
POST {{api}}/api/hr/employees/{{employeeId}}/contracts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2024-03-01", "contractType": "Unlimited", "probationMonths": 0,
  "accommodationProvided": false, "foodProvided": true, "gratuityBasis": "Basic",
  "components": [
    { "componentCode": "BASIC", "amount": 3000 },
    { "componentCode": "HOUSING", "amount": 1000 },
    { "componentCode": "TRANSPORT", "amount": 500 }
  ]
}

### 6. QID expiry (shows up in the expiring-documents list and daily reminders)
POST {{api}}/api/hr/employees/{{employeeId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "docType": "Qid", "docNo": "28435612345", "expiryDate": "2026-12-15" }

### 7. Overtime for the month
POST {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-inputs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employeeId": "{{employeeId}}", "year": 2026, "month": 10, "componentCode": "OVERTIME", "overtimeType": "Normal", "hours": 10 }

### 8. Payroll run → calculate → approve → post
# @name run
POST {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "year": 2026, "month": 10 }

###
@runId = {{run.response.body.id}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs/{{runId}}/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs/{{runId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs/{{runId}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Generate the WPS Salary Information File, then download it
# @name wps
POST {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs/{{runId}}/wps-files
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/hr/wps-files/{{wps.response.body.id}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Accounting impact
GET {{api}}/api/finance/reports/trial-balance?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/hr/reports/gratuity-liability?asOf=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/hr/documents/expiring?withinDays=90
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Payslips as bilingual PDF (all employees, one per page)
GET {{api}}/api/hr/payroll-runs/{{runId}}/payslips.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Final settlement (draft): gratuity, leave encashment, unpaid salary, recoveries
# @name settlement
POST {{api}}/api/hr/employees/{{employeeId}}/final-settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lastWorkingDay": "2026-10-31", "reason": "Resignation", "noticePay": 0, "airTicket": 1200 }

###
GET {{api}}/api/hr/final-settlements/{{settlement.response.body.id}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Post it (terminates the employee, releases the gratuity provision)
POST {{api}}/api/hr/final-settlements/{{settlement.response.body.id}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
